[node name="UndercroftFund" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = -8
position = Vector2(390, -370)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("4_story_item")
interaction_name = "Lift the Hatch"
flag_to_set = "cou_tribute_fund_found"
discovery_text = "[b]The undercroft[/b]

The flagstone in the side chapel is no flagstone at all, but an oak hatch dressed with slate. Worn steps go down into the cold. Among the old burial niches sits an iron-banded chest with three locks, though only one of them is fastened.

Inside are council purses, each tagged with a season in Elder Mathias's hand. A slate on the lid keeps the Tithe in chalk, one autumn to a line: the coin that went out with the cart, and beside it, a name. Five autumns. Five names. The newest line has its coin counted and its name left blank.

This is the reserve the minutes call 'as kept'. The Tithe takes coin as well as a person, and Thornhaven keeps both under the Dawn."
reexamine_text = "The chest under the chapel still holds the council's purses, and the slate still pairs each autumn's coin with a name."

