[node name="MourningCrepe" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(310, -300)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("4_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look Closer"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]A scrap of black crepe[/b]

Caught on a nail by the side chapel steps: a torn strip of black mourning crepe, the kind a widow pins to her sleeve. The dust around the hatch has been swept, but not well. Fresh candle wax is spattered on the top step.

Someone comes down here at night, and they come in mourning."
reexamine_text = "Black mourning crepe, fresh wax, and dust swept in a hurry."

