position = Vector2(-240, -440)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("4_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the Remembrance Board"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The Dawn's remembrance[/b]

Names chalked on blackened board, so the Dawn will know whom to wake. Most are old: a whole column for the plague winter, in Mathias's hand, with 'the grey fever' written above them.

A newer column has no heading, because nobody would agree to write one. Corin Ashby. Davin, the smith's boy. Hesk Marlow. Willa Brand. One a year, five autumns running, and a space left beneath them.

Apart from the rest: 'the merchant's wife, taken by the grey fever. Her daughter lit this candle.' The candle beneath it has been relit recently."
reexamine_text = "The plague-winter names, the four the Tithe took with a space beneath them, and the merchant's wife. Her candle is still lit."

