[node name="AlmsBox" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(110, 400)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("4_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the Alms Box"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The alms box[/b]

An oak box by the door, its slot polished by years of coins. It is empty. The lock has been forced and mended twice.

A card tacked above it reads: 'For the roof, the poor and the Dawn.' Beneath, someone has scratched with a knife-point: 'and the forest.'"
reexamine_text = "Empty, forced twice. 'For the roof, the poor and the Dawn - and the forest.'"

