[node name="LotUrn" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(60, -336)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("4_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the Lot Urn"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The lot urn[/b]

An iron urn on a stand before the altar, black with age and handling, its lid on a short chain. Inside, the village in tiles: one for every name old enough to be counted, each a small slab of grey iron with the name cut in, and on the back a hammer over a pine tree. Bjorn cast every one of them.

The elder keeps the urn. The rite says the Dawn chooses, and that a hand which knew the tiles would be a sin against it."
reexamine_text = "The urn of iron tiles, every one stamped with Bjorn's hammer and pine."

