[node name="DrawnTile" type="Area2D" parent="Interactables"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-170, -330)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("4_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look at the Drawn Tile"
flag_to_set = "recut_tile_seen"
discovery_text = "[b]Elena's tile[/b]

By custom the drawn tile lies on the lectern until the cart comes, so the name can be seen and prayed over. ELENA, cut in square letters into grey iron, Bjorn's hammer and pine on the back.

Turned to the candle, it is wrong. The face is filed lower than the tiles in the urn, and bright where the file went. The letters are careful but unpractised, each cut twice where a smith would cut once. And beneath the E, where the iron was not filed quite flat, is the ghost of a stroke that belongs to no letter of her name.

Someone filed away the name this tile was cast for, and cut hers in its place."
reexamine_text = "ELENA, recut by a careful, unpractised hand over a name filed away."

